  "title": {
   "en": "Kami Ni Chikatte Itsuwaridesu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "神に誓って偽りです"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Swear to God It's a Lie."
   },
   {
    "pt-br": "Eu Juro Por Deus, é Mentira."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Momoyuan Matsuri, is the owner of the Fukufuku Restaurant, which has a store in Chinatown. However, her mother was tricked by bad people and disappeared, leaving her with a huge debt, and her precious restaurant is in danger of being repossessed. Matsuri decides that she wants to get the money back from the people who tricked her mother, so she follows her mother's words and visits Seiichi Mikado, a psychology teacher at a university. However, Seiichi is a very different person from the image of a “skilled swindler” that Matsuri had in her mind."
  },
